 "summary": "Microsoft's XML-based declarative language for instantiating .NET object graphs: elements map to CLR types, attributes and property elements to properties, with markup extensions ({Binding}, {StaticResource}), attached properties and x: language directives. Used by WPF, UWP/WinUI, Xamarin.Forms/.NET MAUI and (as dialects) Avalonia and Uno.",
 "status": "active",
